        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The new Edge browser will use a new technology for video communication that should replace WebRTC.",
      "dimensions": [
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "tech_route",
      "primary_dimension": "strategy",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "km25__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project aims to add the possibility for several users to communicate in a web conference.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "km25__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project plans to allow audio communication for users without a webcam or those who do not want to use it.",
